                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Since the start of the year, House Democrats have been clear that we will not support a Republican spending bill that raises health care premiums for over 20 million Americans, paves the way for millions to be thrown off Medicaid and the Affordable Care Act, and gives a blank check to Donald Trump to continue his authoritarian rule. The \u201cdeal\u201d Senate Republicans are touting does all of this. I voted against these same shortcomings in September and will do so again if and when it comes back to the House.",
