                "text": "I\u2019m back at the Capitol ahead of a vote on a Republican spending bill that will raise health care premiums for 20 million Americans and pave the way for millions more to lose their coverage. Tune in for more on why I will proudly be voting \u201cno.\u201d https://t.co/M0n2JSsuja",
