                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The motto of the Trump Administration seems to be \u201cthere\u2019s money for me but not for thee.\u201d The Republican spending bill will result in health insurance costs spiking for 20 million Americans. Instead of taking actions for those affected, they included a secret provision allowing Republican Senators to profit $500,000 off the government if they were investigated for their involvement in January 6th.  Blatant corruption while they take away health care.\nhttps://t.co/JVLSlwm91h",
