                "text": "In the wealthiest country in the world, no one should die or go into debt because of an improper health insurance claim denial, and yet, for millions of Americans a split-second denial by their insurance company wrongly determines their fate. \n\n@BobbyScott and I brought this critical issue to the attention of the Department of Labor and outlined a strategy to ensure Americans can get the care they need when they need it. \nhttps://t.co/TMxoNFjHle",
