                "text": "As Republicans strip away millions of Americans' health care to pay for tax breaks for billionaires, I am hosting an @EdWorkforceDems subcommittee shadow hearing on the importance of extending ACA tax credits to protect the health and wellbeing of working families. Tune in tomorrow at 2:00 p.m. EST to learn more about how House Democrats are fighting to preserve the ACA amidst Republican attacks: https://t.co/Bdm9Lv21LQ",
