                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today I held a shadow hearing to affirm what my @HouseDemocrats colleagues and the American people already know \u2013 health care is deeply unaffordable in this country. I gathered other members of @EdWorkforceDems along with health experts, small businesses owners, and Marketplace enrollees to discuss the urgent need to extend the Affordable Care Act Premium Tax Credits now so millions Americans do not lose their care.",
