                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I spoke on behalf of American workers and retirees at today\u2019s Health, Employment, Labor, and Pensions Subcommittee hearing following the Trump Administration\u2019s gutting of the department responsible for ensuring they receive the benefits they paid into. Rather than leaving American families unprotected, we should be working to ensure that no family is denied the health care benefits they deserve.",
