                "text": "This week I held a shadow hearing to bring to the forefront an issue my Republican colleagues don\u2019t want to address in @EdWorkforceDems \u2013 how their policies are making health care unaffordable for millions of Americans. We discussed how Democrats are fighting to extend the ACA tax credits to protect your care. Tune in to hear more about the hearing and what the rest of the week held.",
