                "text": "As the Ranking Member for the Health, Employment, Labor, and Pensions Subcommittee, at our hearing today I reiterated a simple truth: you cannot be pro-worker and anti-union. My Republican colleagues want to undermine the organizations that support workers while doing nothing to combat corporations that use their outsized power to engage in anti-worker activity. Workers \u2013 not Washington \u2013 must decide their union\u2019s future. @EdWorkforceDems",
